        "tools_exact": true,
        "no_write": true,
        "plan_missing": false,
        "citations_min": 0,
        "planned_tools": [
          "positions_snapshot"
        ]
      },
      "why": "持仓路径只读注入的持仓快照，绝不读 data/ 下的真实文件。",
      "trap": "零参数工具被当成「参数未知」而透传 as_of，报 TOOL_FIELD_FORBIDDEN；空元组的语义是「一个参数都不收」。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "gt-03-report-preview",
      "split": "dev",
      "query": "生成今天的日报",
      "slots": {},
      "approval": "none",
      "expect": {
