      "why": "风控约束只读返回，并且必须声明交易层不可用。",
      "trap": "INTENT_TOOLS 里曾把工具名写成 risk_rules_read（注册表里叫 policy_rules_read），只读路径报 TOOL_UNKNOWN。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "gt-06-push-preview-approved",
      "split": "dev",
      "query": "把日报推送到飞书",
      "slots": {
        "slot": "morning_build"
      },
      "approval": "approve",
